  "rationale": "W28 authored four traditions -- chorale, flesh-codex, shared-mind, witch-bond -- and made gloss and tuningStatus required on a tradition, moving contentRevision a622452a3b55e38fd902a2d3264b44d7 to 1f471d16ed93d75ade4284e72596803b. The gate compares provenance.contentHash as a block, so that alone invalidates the baseline. A second, real mechanism came with it: the god's action-13 candidate list is every tradition except the one held, so the legal action space grew from 2 entries to 6, and the interned tradition id is written into the observation vector. Measured rather than assumed -- NO METRIC MOVED on this gate or on either of the other two. So this regeneration is a provenance refresh, not a behaviour change, and the widened action space is measurably inert on a 100 percent passive-control sweep that submits no god verb. The reference tradition did not move: scribingTraditionId still returns true-naming on the seven-tradition set. No rules constant and no god constant was touched, and NO GOLDEN FIXTURE WAS REGENERATED. This file is a measurement, not a balance claim: release-plan.md forbids a balance claim before 0.5.0. The W28 record is docs/superpowers/plans/w28-magic-regimes.md; the tree's prior integration record is docs/superpowers/plans/integration-round-2.md.",
